Ratify_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── when offers empty
│  └── it should revert with LeafCountNotPowerOfTwo
├── when offer count not power of two
│  └── it should revert with LeafCountNotPowerOfTwo
└── when offer count power of two
   ├── when maker not vault
   │  └── it should revert with InvalidMaker
   ├── when offer is sell
   │  └── it should revert with NotBuyOffer
   ├── when ratifier not setter ratifier
   │  └── it should revert with InvalidRatifier
   ├── when market family not allowlisted
   │  └── it should revert with FamilyNotAllowed
   ├── when maturity passed
   │  └── it should revert with MaturityOutOfRange
   ├── when maturity beyond max time to maturity
   │  └── it should revert with MaturityOutOfRange
   ├── when expiry after maturity
   │  └── it should revert with ExpiryAfterMaturity
   ├── when continuous fee cap above max
   │  └── it should revert with ContinuousFeeCapTooHigh
   ├── when callback not created by factory
   │  └── it should revert with OfferCallbackNotAllowed
   ├── when callback not owned by vault
   │  └── it should revert with OfferCallbackNotAllowed
   ├── when funding market not allowlisted
   │  └── it should revert with FundingMarketNotAllowed
   ├── when funding loan token differs from market loan token
   │  └── it should revert with LoanTokenMismatch
   ├── when only a later leaf is invalid
   │  └── it should revert with the index of that leaf
   └── when all offers valid
      ├── given adapter not authorized on Midnight
      │  └── it should revert in the ratifier
      └── given adapter authorized on Midnight
         ├── when offer maturity differs from allowlisted family maturity
         │  └── it should ratify the root
         ├── when maturity equals max time to maturity and expiry equals maturity
         │  └── it should ratify the root
         └── when offer maturity equals allowlisted family maturity
            ├── it should ratify the Merkle root of the offers for the vault
            ├── it should return the root
            └── it should emit MidnightRootSet
